From 8846d9a2f881c3c9f3045bbc6bae1e6636fe9858 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 06:56:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/17] test-posix: Check the <string.h> and <strings.h> names
 in strict mode

The types, prototypes and functions behind any macros; nothing the
headers don't reserve (extensions, the XSI memccpy, ffs, ffsl and ffsll,
the removed bcmp family, free); and parameter names an application may
define as macros.
